<title>USA: A&amp;W Restaurants to acquire Carousel Snack Bars.</title>
<headline>A&amp;W Restaurants to acquire Carousel Snack Bars.</headline>
<dateline>LIVONIA, Mich. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A&amp;W Restaurants Inc said Thursday it signed an agreement to acquire  Carousel Snack Bars of Minnesota Inc, owner of 175 restaurants operating under the name of A&amp;W Hot Dogs &amp; More.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>With the acquisition, A&amp;W will become an owner and operator of 175 restaurants, while also continuing to be a franchiser of restaurants.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
